IAD1
#
# Measurements made by Anisha Bahl at King's College of a PDMS
# without glass slides using a dual beam spectrometer
#
# PDMS Refractive index from 
# https://refractiveindex.info/?shelf=organic&book=polydimethylsiloxane&page=Schneider-RTV615
#
# Process this file as 'iad -X -i 8 -g 0.9 filename'
#
1.41  # Index of refraction of sample
1.00  # Index of refraction of slides
2.65  # [mm] Thickness of sample
0     # [mm] Thickness of slides
10    # [mm] Diameter of illumination beam 
0.98  # Reflectance of calibration standard

1     # [mm] Number of spheres used during each measurement

# Reflection sphere properties
100   # [mm] Sphere Diameter
21.8  # [mm] Sample Port Diameter
18.3  # [mm] Empty Port Diameter
8     # [mm] Detector Port Diameter
0.98  # Reflectivity of the sphere wall

# Transmission sphere properties
100   # [mm] Sphere Diameter
18.3  # [mm] Sample Port Diameter
0     # [mm] Empty Port Diameter
8     # [mm] Detector Port Diameter
0.98  # Reflectivity of the sphere wall

